{
  "name": "lagoon",
  "label": "Lagoon",
  "description": "A PS2-era JRPG island, after Final Fantasy X and Chrono Cross. By day a sunlit beach under a big sky; after dark the night tide under the moon, with pyreflies drifting up. Menus, dialogs, tooltips and toasts are classic blue menu windows with a silver edge, and the pointing hand marks the active item. Cinzel titles, sea-glass keys that glint, cards with a wave along the foot, elemental-orb avatars and spinner, an ATB gauge for progress and a pearl on the switch.",
  "fonts": "https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cinzel:wght@500;600;700;800&family=M+PLUS+Rounded+1c:wght@400;500;700;800&family=M+PLUS+1+Code:wght@400;500;700&display=swap",
